\fs36 \cf0 1. Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This project evaluates cybersecurity risks for a fictional small online boutique called Moonlit Market. The business has eight employees and handles customer information and online orders.\
The purpose of this assessment is to identify potential security risks, evaluate their severity, and recommend practical controls to reduce the likelihood and impact of cybersecurity incidents.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2. Scope and Assumptions\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The assessment focuses on common cybersecurity risks that could affect a small online business, including:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Employee account compromise\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ransomware and malware\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Unauthorized access to customer information\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Backup and recovery failures\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Phishing attacks\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Moonlit Market is a fictional business created for educational purposes. No real business systems, accounts, or customer data were accessed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

