\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Risk Prioritization\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 I prioritized risks based on their calculated scores. Risks with higher scores were treated as higher priorities because they could have more serious consequences for the business.\
I then identified recommended security controls for each risk, considering the needs and resources of a small business.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 6. Recommended Security Controls\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The recommendations focused on practical security improvements, including:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
