\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Action Planning\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 I created an action plan to organize recommended improvements by priority, assigned owner, and target completion timeframe.\
The plan is intended to help the business address its highest-priority risks first and track progress toward improving its security posture.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

