\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 9. Limitations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This assessment is based on a fictional business scenario and simplified risk-scoring criteria. It does not include vulnerability scanning, penetration testing, interviews, or verification of real security controls.\
Actual risk levels may differ depending on a business's systems, existing safeguards, threat environment, and operational requirements.\
